00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:46,000
Nosferatu is a horror, fantasy film directed by Robert Eggers.

3
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:06,000
A gothic tale of obsession between a haunted young woman and the terrifying
vampire infatuated with her, causing untold horror in its wake.

4
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:26,000
Ellen Hutter, played by Lily-Rose Depp.

5
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:46,000
Thomas Hutter, played by Nicholas Hoult.

6
